ll-doesn-t-have-a-plan.json, ni:///sha-256;HdWquMm0AHWdz7p65-ZpCRzoNTveU8ItQAnuGAk-mow): \"proposition\": { \"predicate\": \"summary\", \"object\": \"The biggest game in soccer is set for Sunday, when Argentina and Spain will meet in the World Cup final, held just outside of New York City. Thereâ€™s just one problem â€” wildfire smoke now threatens the match and FIFA, the sportâ€™s governing body, doesnâ€™t appear to have any plan in place to protect player or fan health.&nbsp; Wildfire smoke blowing from Canada has blanketed large swaths of the Midwest and East Coast in recent days, i mpacting more than a dozen states , with some of the worst-hit cities facing air quality in ranges considered hazardous. New Yorkers are among those who have been watching their air turn orange and hazy this we...","Prior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): { \"subject\": \"the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster\", \"claims\": [ {","Prior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): \"proposition\": { \"predicate\": \"title\", \"object\": \"The World Cup is one wildfire away from an air quality disaster\" }, \"time\": {","Prior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): \"provenance\": { \"witness\": \"collapse-climate\", \"citation\": \"https://grist.org/extreme-weather/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster/\" }, \"status\": \"supported\"","Prior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): \"proposition\": { \"predicate\": \"url\", \"object\": \"https://grist.org/extreme-weather/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster/\" }, \"time\": {","Prior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): \"provenance\": { \"witness\": \"collapse-climate\", \"citation\": \"https://grist.org/extreme-weather/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster/\" }, \"status\": \"supported\""],"accountableAttention":{"rule":"make-the-click-preserve-the-warrant","headlineMustPreserve":["attribution","modality","scope","uncertainty","correction state"],"forbiddenStrengthenings":["source claim to newsroom fact","may/could/alleged to does/did/proves","single case to trend","correlation to causation","reader demand to evidence"],"correctionSurfacePolicy":"Any later correction to a cited claim must propagate to body copy, headline, social cards, feeds, JSON-LD, and syndicated packets."},"constraints":["This packet is research intake, not a publishable article.","Only current-provider claims are admitted as source-bound factual evidence.","Prior-corpus excerpts are contextual leads until separately sourced and admitted.","Publication still requires a licensed editorial state, exact-manuscript judgment, and explicit publishing action."]}}]

